<v Ira Glass>我们的网站：thisamericanlife.org。《美国生活》由公共广播国际公司发行。

00:59:30.330 --> 00:59:40.020
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our show by our boss, Mr. Torey Malatia, who is, I don't know, kind of harsh. Back years ago when I first showed him my idea for this radio show--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理层对我们节目的监督由我们的老板托雷·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）先生负责，他，我不知道，有点苛刻。多年前我第一次向他展示我的电台节目想法时——

00:59:40.020 --> 00:59:44.640
<v Terry Engelder>Oh, boy, you know, [CRUMPLES PAPER] into the trash bin.
<v Terry Engelder>天哪，你知道……（揉皱纸张的声音）扔进了垃圾桶。

00:59:44.640 --> 01:00:05.810
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周回来带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

01:00:05.810 --> 01:00:10.810
